  "attributes": {
    "_comment": "Staff realm (window 2, Phase 1). Users mirror packages/db SEED_IDS.users; user id == staff_user.keycloak_subject (seed-<key>). Roles live in OpenFGA, never here. DEV ONLY: the OTP step is CONDITIONAL (issue #43) and owner is pre-enrolled with a documented TOTP secret; production realms make OTP REQUIRED. Details in infra/keycloak/README.md.",
    "frontendUrl": "http://localhost:8180"
